      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Subgrafo:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "AcxRu0p-n_HK6NQJP5QXV",
      "type": "ellipse",
      "x": -316.2612279253009,
      "y": 1144.6429939753857,
      "width": 209.63633872610433,
      "height": 90.78739078689546,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#c2255c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b74",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 2
      },
      "seed": 2025895146,
      "version": 158,
      "versionNonce": 1231378391,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1769208841825,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JJ_lz5JvUvYWcnzJQKTmj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -310.81455670164723,
      "y": 1267.905987275167,
      "width": 1369.0999755859375,
      "height": 675,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b75",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 809728938,
      "version": 414,
      "versionNonce": 527195063,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1769211640341,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dado un grafo G = (V , E), un subgrafo \nde G es un grafo H = (W , F ) tal que:\n \nW ⊆ V ^ F ⊆ E\n\nEjemplo: \n\nG = ({A, B, C, D, E} , { {A, B}, {A, C}, {A, E}, {C, E} })              \n\nEntonces un subgrafo H de G podría ser el siguiente Grafo:\n\nH = ({A, B, C} , { {A, C} })\n\nPues {A,B,C} ⊆ {A, B, C, D, E} ^ {A, C} ⊆ { {A, B}, {A, C}, {A, E}, {C, E} }  \n    ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dado un grafo G = (V , E), un subgrafo \nde G es un grafo H = (W , F ) tal que:\n \nW ⊆ V ^ F ⊆ E\n\nEjemplo: \n\nG = ({A, B, C, D, E} , { {A, B}, {A, C}, {A, E}, {C, E} })              \n\nEntonces un subgrafo H de G podría ser el siguiente Grafo:\n\nH = ({A, B, C} , { {A, C} })\n\nPues {A,B,C} ⊆ {A, B, C, D, E} ^ {A, C} ⊆ { {A, B}, {A, C}, {A, E}, {C, E} }  \n    ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "3FaNTNH0ZmYVcpZrTr63R",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -319.06246925259245,
